1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,136
You said approvals were moving before the client had even seen the plan.

2
00:00:04,136 --> 00:00:07,590
So now nothing moves until the client says yes.

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:11,920
They read it, they confirm it, they rate the advice, and they sign.

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:14,342
Only then can a manager approve.

